________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
v1.2.1

THIS UPDATE IS SAVE COMPATABLE WITH THE PREVIOUS UPDATE

-Added bar events that provide custom production capabilities to the trail, accessed through bar events at any market along the Trail. Ordering production can generate contacts for more permanant production needs.
-Fixed Trail hardships occuring before the player has learned of the Trail's existence
-Fixed several bugs relating to the occurance of trail hardships

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
v1.2.0

THIS UPDATE MAY BE SAVE COMPATABLE, BUT I DONT GUARANTEE IT

-Added scavenge/salvage fleets to the Remainder
-Added civilian fleets to the Remainder
-Added TTCPauseMigration command [pauses at the current stage/progress through the sector, but all other behaviour continues as normal]
-Added so The Farms can spawn multiple wrecks
-Added a second set of descriptions for markets that appear on Habitable planets (this is applied retroactively to savegames)

-Improvements to debug commands
-Factions will no longer instantly rebuild their markets if they are destroyed, but rather needs to wait for one jump to get their market cap back

-Fixed bug causing crash if every single market of a given subfaction is destroyed at once
-Fixed incorrect spawn counts for station industry
-Fixed incorrect despawn timers for civilian/scout fleets
-Fixed rare but random crash when a Station Market accidentally spawns a ruined station with invalid orbit

- Added Lohraru Generic Tactics Vehicle
- Added Primary Laser

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
v1.1.0

THIS UPDATE IS NOT SAVE COMPATABLE

- Fixes some crashes reported by various players related to lambda functions, unfortunately Nicke tells me that this fix won't work on existing saves.
- Adds player storage to all markets along the trail. Access to storage needs to be purchased seperately per sub-faction, but it is all the same storage.
- Changes how Trail station garrisons work, which should fix the campaign level UI bug when mousing over them, as well as fixing the garrison fleet not retreating during the station fight.
- Improved custom fleet spawning logic.
- The Farms now leaves a visual ring of debris around stars it's been built around. This will make it easier to tell where the trail has been.
- Improved the spawning behavior of strange ruins. The Farms now always spawns strange stations, planets almost always spawn strange ruins (although their loot value is mild) and other space markets should spawn strange stations more often.
- Adjusted trail migration timings.
- Adjusted subfaction fleet compositions.
- Added a new ship.

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
v1.0.3

This update should be save compatable, but many of the descriptor additions won't show up on markets present on game load, you will need to wait until they move before the descriptions show up.

There's still more polishing up and fleshing out to do, please be patient with me and Nicke, there's quite a lot of work to do before we can start working on all new content again.

- Added a lot of the market/bar related descriptions that were missing from the initial release (The Remainder is still bugged, we're working on it)
- Added an intel event that tracks the Farms on the map, wether it was discovered by you, or the global timer reveal event.
- Fixed a crash related to the phased array weapons
- Adjusted Trail migration timing
- adjusted Subfaction market spawning values

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
v1.0.2

This seems to work with my own save, but I make no guarantees.

- Added Jose's last name
- Added Takaya's last name
- Reduced the number of markets available to all 3 subfactions
- Adjusted the timing and spread of Trail movements
- Fixed a bug where none of the subfactions knew any fighter LPCs whatsoever
- Fixed a bug where the Remainder would not start hostile to the player
- A number of balance tweaks to various ships and weapons, mostly nerfs this time around.
